{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/NMF Multiplicative Update.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/NMF Multiplicative Update.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"nmf multiplicative update nmf multiplicative update","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/NMF Multiplicative Update.md","fileName":"NMF Multiplicative Update.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"NMF Multiplicative Update","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 21:34\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Matrix Factorization and Spectral Clustering]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Matrix Factorization and Spectral Clustering","dataclustering.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/NMF Multiplicative Update.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/NMF Multiplicative Update.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"nmf multiplicative update nmf multiplicative update","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/NMF Multiplicative Update.md","fileName":"NMF Multiplicative Update.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"NMF Multiplicative Update","heading":"NMF Multiplicative Update","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A multiplicative update alternately rescales the two nonnegative factors using ratios of terms derived from the reconstruction objective. Starting from nonnegative values, the updates preserve nonnegativity without a separate projection step.\n\nThe objective is nonconvex in both factors together, so the procedure can reach different stationary solutions from different initializations. Small entries may also change slowly, making stopping rules and numerical safeguards important.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Matrix Factorization and Spectral Clustering","dataclustering.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/NMF Multiplicative Update.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/NMF Multiplicat